{
  "_note": "多城市卡:「我的城市」前 5 座各一行。整卡天空底(第一座城市的天空档)+ 每行该城天空档色板原色,白字。\nv64 起与另外几张卡统一成天空家族(此前白 / 黑底列表卡 + 浅色 16% 淡染行)。\n由 tools/infosource/gen_weather_cities.py 生成。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_sky",
          "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${sk0},overcast)]"
        },
        "_note": "整卡天空底与另外几张卡同一套(v64 起;此前是白 / 黑底列表卡,摆在一组天空卡里像别的包)。\n⚠️ 卡底必须自绘:桌面小组件贴在**壁纸**上,不画底就是一堆浮在照片上的字。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},clear)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#2F7FC4\\,#6FB4E0\\,#A9D2EC)@90|linear(#1F5C90\\,#487F9E\\,#6E9AB0)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},overcast)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#6B7E8E\\,#93A5B2\\,#B9C6CF)@90|linear(#4A5763\\,#6A7783\\,#8A96A0)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},rain)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#3E5A73\\,#5C7B93\\,#89A3B5)@90|linear(#2A3F52\\,#42596C\\,#647D8C)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},snow)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#7C93A8\\,#A8BCCB\\,#D6E3EC)@90|linear(#586A7A\\,#7B8D9B\\,#9FB0BC)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${_sky},night)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "layer",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "0pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}",
            "h": "{parent.h}",
            "bgColor": "linear(#101A2E\\,#1C2A44\\,#33465F)@90|linear(#0A1220\\,#141F33\\,#25344A)@90"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#00000000\\,#4D000000)@90|linear(#00000000\\,#59000000)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "srcDot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#7FC4F5|#7FC4F5"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-46pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.t}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "_note": "页眉与 now / today / week 同款:浅蓝圆点 + 13pt 白色粗体,y=12。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[gt::(${n},0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "if",
            "props": {
              "val": "$[eq::(${sk0},clear)]"
            },
